#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:59
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&jovie; - the &kde; Text-to-Speech system - is a plugin based service that "
"allows any &kde; (or non-&kde;) application to speak using the &DBus; "
"interface."
msgstr ""
"&jovie; - the &kde; Tekst-u-govor sistem - je servis baziran na pluginu koji "
"omogućuje bilo kojoj &kde; (ili ne-&kde;) aplikaciji da komunicira putem "
"&DBUS; interfejsa."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:65
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&jovie; intends to be the implementation for the &kde; Text-to-Speech API."
msgstr "&jovie; namjerava biti implementacija za &kde; Tekst-u-govor API."

