#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:1284
#, no-c-format
msgid "Installation"
msgstr "Instalacija"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:1290
#, no-c-format
msgid "How to obtain &jovie;"
msgstr "Kako dobiti &jovie;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1292
#, no-c-format
msgid "&install.intro.documentation;"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1296
#, no-c-format
msgid "Debian Install Command: <command>apt-get install jovie</command>"
msgstr ""
"Debian naredba za instalaciju: <command>apt-get install jovie</command>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1299
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You will find links to source and binary packages on the <ulink url=\"http://"
"accessibility.kde.org/developer/kttsd/\"> &kde; Accessibility</ulink> web "
"site (http://accessibility.kde.org)."
msgstr ""
"Možete naći linkove za izvorni kod i izvršne datoteke na <ulink url=\"http://"
"accessibility.kde.org/developer/kttsd/\"> &kde; Accessibility</ulink> "
"internet stranici (http://accessibility.kde.org)."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1303
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you have access to the &kde; code repository, you can download &jovie; by "
"checking out the <command>jovie</command> archive. &jovie; will be found in "
"the <filename class=\"directory\">jovie</filename> folder. You can also "
"download tarballs of the &jovie; source code from <ulink url=\"http://"
"download.kde.org/stable/\">http://download.kde.org/stable/</ulink>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:1316
#, no-c-format
msgid "Requirements"
msgstr "Zahtjevi"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1318
#, no-c-format
msgid "Mandatory requirements:"
msgstr "Obavezni zahtjevi:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1322
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kde; version 4.8 or later."
msgstr "&kde; verzija 4.8 ili novije."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1323
#, no-c-format
msgid "speech-dispatcher version 0.67 or later."
msgstr "speech-dispatcher verzija 0.67 ili novije."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1324
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A speech synthesizer. The following synthesizers and spoken languages are "
"currently supported."
msgstr ""
"Govorni sintesajzer. Sljedeći sintesajzeri i jezici su trenutno podržani."

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:1333
#, no-c-format
msgid "Espeak"
msgstr "Espeak"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:1334
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Most languages, check <ulink url=\"http://espeak.sourceforge.net/languages."
"html\">http://espeak.sourceforge.net/languages.html</ulink> for the current "
"list of supported languages"
msgstr ""
"Većina jezika, provjerite <ulink url=\"http://espeak.sourceforge.net/"
"languages.html\">http://espeak.sourceforge.net/languages.html</ulink> za "
"trenutnu listu podržanih jezika"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:1339
#, no-c-format
msgid "Festival"
msgstr "Festival"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:1340
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"American English, British, Spanish, German, Finnish, Czech, Polish, Russian, "
"Italian, French Canadian, Kiswahili, Zulu, and Ibibio"
msgstr ""
"Američki Engleski, Britanski, Španski, Njemački, Finski, Češki, Poljski, "
"Ruski, Italijanski, Francuski Kanadski, Kisvahili, Zulu, i Ibibio"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1349
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"It also works with any synthesis engine that can be run from a command in a "
"&konsole;."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1352
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The languages listed above may not be comprehensive or up-to-date. Check the "
"specifications for each engine for a complete list of supported languages. "
"Also check the <ulink url=\"http://accessibility.kde.org/developer/kttsd/"
"index.php\"> &jovie;</ulink> website for additional information that might "
"not have made it into this handbook."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1362
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"speech-dispatcher uses a flexible plugin architecture for speech synthesis "
"engines. If you want to enhance &jovie; to support another engine, contact "
"the development team."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1369
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"See <xref linkend=\"configuration\"/> for specific instructions for each of "
"these engines."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1377
#, no-c-format
msgid "Optional components:"
msgstr "Neobavezne komponente:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1383
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <command>xsltproc</command> utility is needed for SSML support and for "
"the &XML; Transformer filter, but not required. Debian users can install "
"xsltproc with the command <command>apt-get install xsltproc</command>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:1397
#, no-c-format
msgid "Compilation and Installation"
msgstr "Izrada i instalacija"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1399
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In order to compile &jovie;, you must have a recent (&kde; 4.8 or greater) "
"copy of the &kde; development files, including kdelibs and the development "
"files for speech-dispatcher."
msgstr ""
"Da bi ste izradili &jovie;, morate imati svježiju(&kde; 4.8 ili novije) "
"kopiju &kde; datoteka za razvoj, uključujući kdelibs i datoteke za razvoj za "
"govor-dispečer."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1403
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you downloaded the &jovie; source from the <filename>kdeaccessibility</"
"filename> code repository module, or downloaded the nightly tarball, use the "
"following commands to compile and install."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: programlisting
#: index.docbook:1408
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"cd jovie\n"
"mkdir build\n"
"cd build\n"
"cmake ../\n"
"make\n"
"sudo make install"
msgstr ""
"cd jovie\n"
"mkdir build\n"
"cd build\n"
"cmake ../\n"
"make\n"
"sudo make install"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:1416
#, no-c-format
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "Podešavanja"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1418
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Make sure speech-dispatcher is working with your speech synthesis engine "
"before using &jovie;. The shell script spd-conf can be used for that."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1421
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&jovie; in &kde; 4.5 is a rename of KTTSD and kttsmgr. In the future &jovie; "
"will be able to configure speech-dispatcher directly without spd-conf."
msgstr ""
